{\"id\":\"fs_128\",\"fact\":\"RuView (π RuView, 59.7k★) — turns commodity WiFi signals into real-time spatial intelligence: presence detection, vital sign monitoring (breathing 6-30 BPM, heart rate 40-120 BPM), through-wall sensing. Hardware cost: $9 per ESP32-S3 node + optional $140 Cognitum Seed. 1463 passing tests. No cameras or wearables required — pure physics (Channel State Information from WiFi subcarriers).\",\"source\":\"https://github.com/ruvnet/RuView (GitHub Trending, 59.7k★, May 19-20 2026)\",\"date\":\"2026-05-19\",\"tags\":\"stable,hardware,WiFi,sensing,spatial-computing,signal-processing\",\"confidence\":0.9}
